    TEST-0002: one end-to-end test through run()
    
    The test goes in the front door: run() with argv, the real core, and a
    real JsonBookingStore on a temporary file. It books a room with one
    command, then tries an overlapping time with a second command, each
    with a new store on the same file, the way each yarn start does.
    
    There's only one, because the rules are already covered by the core's
    unit tests and the file by the contract. This one checks that main.ts
    wires them together.

